Server dialect hooks: every outbound message passes WydDialectOutbound
before CPSock obfuscation and every inbound frame passes WydDialectInbound
before scene dispatch. WydDialect.{h,cpp} are copied from client/dialect by
tools/apply_openwyd_patches.py.

